{"id":"n28331-1-7","stage":4,"title":"늑대 · 狼","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28331-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 개처럼 생긴 저 동물의 이름이 뭐예요?","zh":"妈妈，那只长得像狗的动物叫什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"개처럼","meaning":"狗，犬","explanation":"개：狗，犬；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64115","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개처럼","audio":"/audio/ee0aef64da592458bd8e.mp3"}},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"长","explanation":"생기다：长；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"4","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생긴","audio":"/audio/6a1f8f2f14401a79cbc7.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"동물의","meaning":"动物","explanation":"동물：动物；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"동물","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70747","senseId":"1","lemma":"동물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동물의","audio":"/audio/5a4f55315831723e39c5.mp3"}},{"text":"이름이","meaning":"名字，名称","explanation":"이름：名字，名称；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이름이","audio":"/audio/7664b0b2ec8a24b4d722.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐예요","audio":"/audio/4f5cef3090eaab6a16ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"狗，犬","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"64115","definition":"一种以打猎或玩赏等为目的饲养的动物，嗅觉和听觉都很灵敏，头脑聪明，顺从听话。","pronunciation":["개ː"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"长","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"人或事物的长相成为某种样子。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"227e25cceb2f8449","term":"동물","zh":"动物","audio":"/audio/227e25cceb2f8449c2a4.mp3","entryId":"70747","definition":"在生物界的两条分支中，从食物中获取营养，并可以自由活动的生物。","pronunciation":["동ː물"]},{"id":"253d1510caf53620","term":"이름","zh":"名字，名称","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3","entryId":"71692","definition":"为了区别于他物，给动物、事物、现象等而赋予的称号。","pronunciation":["이름"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/406d0ace8d3a6faadb75.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28331-1-7-2","ko":"저 동물은 늑대라고 한단다.","zh":"那是狼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading